tml</link><description>&lt;p&gt;对工薪阶层来说，基金定投无疑是一种比较好的投资方式，每个月把结余投入到权益品种，享受经济增长的红利。本文介绍定投的几个方式以及收益率。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 23 Jun 2022 22:43:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-06-23:/20220623.html</guid><category>wealth</category><category>交易策略</category><category>策略回测</category><category>基金定投</category></item><item><title>长期来看，每个人都将找到一个舒服的姿势躺平</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220604.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;躺平新解&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 04 Jun 2022 14:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-06-04:/20220604.html</guid><category>essay</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>一键构建 IKEv2 VPN 服务器</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/ikev2-vpn.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;适合于 ubuntu 22.04，基于 strongswan 构建 IKEv2 VPN 服务器&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jun 2022 23:22:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-06-01:/ikev2-vpn.html</guid><category>tools</category><category>tools</category></item><item><title>一文读懂唐朝交易策略</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220515.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;唐朝是个网名，他的公众号“唐书房”拥有众多拥趸，他的策略近几年取得了非常丰厚的收益。今天，我们用一篇文章来理解唐朝的交易策略。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sun, 15 May 2022 22:43:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-05-15:/20220515.html</guid><category>wealth</category><category>交易策略</category><category>策略回测</category><category>唐书房</category></item><item><title>稳定的情绪</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/stable-emotion.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;如果说，人的一生只能发展一个软技能的话，我想投票给“稳定的情绪”。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http