Link="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-19:/20220319.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>榜样的力量</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220318.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;榜样的力量是无穷的。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 18 Mar 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-18:/20220318.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>预期管理</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220317.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;管理好预期，让你的幸福感稳步提升。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 17 Mar 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-17:/20220317.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>编程语言</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220316.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;聊聊不同的编程语言以及一些思维陷阱。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 16 Mar 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-16:/20220316.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>抄底，清仓，卧倒？</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220315.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;抄底，清仓，卧倒？这确实是个问题。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 15 Mar 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-15:/20220315.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>内在动机</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220313.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;奖赏竟然会伤害内在动机？那么怎么样保护并有意识地培养孩子的内在动机么？&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sun, 13 Mar 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-13:/20220313.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>哲学</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220312.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;最终，我们都要回到哲学上来。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 12 Mar 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-12:/20220312.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>当我谈跑步时，我谈些什么</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220311.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;对我个人而言，坚持跑步究竟有何意味。仅此而已。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 11 Mar 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-11:/20220311.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>真相</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220310.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你确认你看到的，听到的就是真相的全部么？&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 10 Mar 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-10:/20220310.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>但行好事，莫问前程</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220308.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;当你对目标感到焦虑，并且短期内也没有有效方法达成目标时，不仿静下心来，找一个可以长期做的，可以享受过程的事情来做。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 08 Mar 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-08:/20220308.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>刘邦的痞气</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220307.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;刘邦是个伟大的开国君王。但史书上却将他的痞气刻画地入木三分。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Mon, 07 Mar 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-07:/20220307.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>过程重要还是结果重要</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220306.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;追求过程，你会很享受，但可能需要牺牲效率。追求结果，你会很高效，但可能牺牲体验。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sun, 06 Mar 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-06:/20220306.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>我差点扼杀了一个有潜质的导演</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220305.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;孩子的教育问题，太宽松，可能会毁了她；太严厉，可能会扼杀她。真是太难了。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 05 Mar 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-05:/20220305.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>开发人员真垃圾</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220304.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;如果你是个软件质量人员，你大概率有过这样的感叹。如果你是个不成熟的管理者，可能也偶尔会有这样的感叹。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 04 Mar 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-04:/20220304.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>细数投资中那些反人性的案例</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220303.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;股谚有云：七亏二平一赚，这和投资的反人性有极大的关系&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 03 Mar 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-03:/20220303.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>你多久没给自己开启个地狱模式了</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220302.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;最近我给自己开启了个地狱模式：连续写 30 天的公众号，日更。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 02 Mar 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-02:/20220302.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>据说冥想能让母猪都变得眉清目秀</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220301.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;冥想又称正念，英文叫 mindfulness 。现代社会生活节奏快，很多人会通过冥想让自己“慢”下来。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 01 Mar 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-03-01:/20220301.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>人生处处有惊喜</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220228.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;站在当下，你可能对未来非常迷茫，我 xxx 这么烂，感觉一辈子也就这样了，一眼就可以望到头。但事后回顾，你会发现原来处处有惊喜，当然有时也会有惊吓。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Mon, 28 Feb 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-02-28:/20220228.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>弱连接的效用</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220227.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;与一个人的工作和事业关系最密切的社会关系并不是“强连接”，而常常是“弱连接”。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sun, 27 Feb 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-02-27:/20220227.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>抖音真是个神奇的软件</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220226.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;抖音真是个神奇的软件，能让一个不识字，不会讲普通话的大妈，对它趋之若鹜。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 26 Feb 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-02-26:/20220226.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>每日随笔 - 俄乌开战</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/20220225.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;俄乌开战是这几天的绝对头条。全球资本市场都受到了不小的影响，网上调侃的段子，图片到处都是。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 25 Feb 2022 23:44:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-02-25:/20220225.html</guid><category>daily</category><category>每日随笔</category></item><item><title>流金岁月（一）- 缺乏信仰的不惑之年</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/%E4%B8%8D%E6%88%96%E4%B9%8B%E5%B9%B4.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;转眼已到不惑之年，却无不惑之感。人生已过大半，生活波澜不惊。不再雄心壮志，亦无深刻缺憾。或许，这就是一个油腻中年大叔该有的状态。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sun, 20 Feb 2022 23:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-02-20:/不或之年.html</guid><category>essay</category><category>流金岁月</category></item><item><title>新说关羽</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/%E6%96%B0%E8%AF%B4%E5%85%B3%E7%BE%BD.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;关羽在中国传统文化里是神一般的存在，是忠义的代名词。这篇文章，从真实历史的角度，重新看一下关羽。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 12 Feb 2022 23:03:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-02-12:/新说关羽.html</guid><category>history</category><category>历史</category></item><item><title>MacOS Monterey 下启用 core dump</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/osx-monterey-core-dump.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;本文记录在 MacOS Montery 下启用 core dump，并对 core dump 进行简单分析的方法。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sun, 30 Jan 2022 09:38:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-01-30:/osx-monterey-core-dump.html</guid><category>tools</category><category>tools</category></item><item><title>我的投资账本不完全手册</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/my-account-book.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;你想知道每年的投资收益是多少么？你想回顾你的交易记录，把买卖点清晰地标注在股份走势图上么？你想了解你的资产配置比例么？试试我的投资账本。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 06 Jan 2022 22:43:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-01-06:/my-account-book.html</guid><category>wealth</category><category>投资记账</category></item><item><title>2021 年投资总结</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/2021-investment-summary.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;2021 年投资总结。一顿操作猛如虎，收益不如二百五。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 05 Jan 2022 23:22:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2022-01-05:/2021-investment-summary.html</guid><category>essay</category><category>投资</category></item><item><title>从敬业度调查看职场</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/engagement-survey.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;很多企业都会做敬业度调查，敬业度调查的分数越高越好还是越低越好？从敬业度调查结果里，能看到哪些职场规则出来？&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 25 Dec 2021 23:24:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2021-12-25:/engagement-survey.html</guid><category>essay</category><category>career</category></item><item><title>职场内卷与挑战</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/blame-not-work.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;职场是个理性大于感性的场所，很多企业鼓励大家相互挑战。然而，有一种职场的“卷”是由挑战对方引发的，需要警惕。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sun, 05 Dec 2021 23:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2021-12-05:/blame-not-work.html</guid><category>essay</category><category>职场</category></item><item><title>陈胜吴广</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/%E9%99%88%E8%83%9C%E5%90%B4%E5%B9%BF.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;陈胜吴广最先发起反抗暴秦统治，但结局却令人唏嘘，我们今天来聊聊这段历史。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 27 Nov 2021 23:43:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2021-11-27:/陈胜吴广.html</guid><category>history</category><category>历史</category></item><item><title>EdgeX 安全组件</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/edgex-security.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;本文用通俗易懂的语言介绍 EdgeX 安全组件及其实现方案&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 14 Aug 2021 23:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2021-08-14:/edgex-security.html</guid><category>edge</category><category>edgex</category><category>security</category></item><item><title>EdgeX 性能分析</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/edgex-pprof.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;本文分析了 EdgeX 在 Raspberry Pi 上的性能，进而评估其在资源受限的 IoT 网关上的技术可行性&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 06 Aug 2021 23:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2021-08-06:/edgex-pprof.html</guid><category>edge</category><category>edgex</category><category>raspberry pi</category><category>pprof</category></item><item><title>为 Raspberry Pi 交叉编译 EdgeX</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/cross-compile-edgex-for-raspberry-pi.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;本文介绍了一种使用 Docker 来交叉编译 Edgex，使之能在 Raspberry Pi 硬件上运行的方法&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 05 Aug 2021 23:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2021-08-05:/cross-compile-edgex-for-raspberry-pi.html</guid><category>edge</category><category>edgex</category><category>raspberry pi</category><category>cross compile</category></item><item><title>从内在动机角度看孩子的教育问题</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/instrinsic-motivation.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;如果能激发孩子的内在动机，让孩子自主地学习，那是一件多么美妙的事情啊。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Mon, 21 Jun 2021 22:22:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2021-06-21:/instrinsic-motivation.html</guid><category>essay</category><category>thought</category></item><item><title>挫折管理 - 通向独立的阶梯</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/independent.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;孩子在这个陌生的世界里闯荡，遇到挫折在所难免。怎么样把挫折经历，变成孩子独立的阶梯，是个值得思考的问题。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Mon, 31 May 2021 22:25:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2021-05-31:/independent.html</guid><category>essay</category><category>thought</category></item><item><title>交易陷阱之缺泛大局观</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/market-overview.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一顿操作猛如虎，微观角度来看，也挑不出什么大毛病。但，由于缺泛大局观，赢了战斗，输了战役。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 22 May 2021 10:53:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2021-05-22:/market-overview.html</guid><category>wealth</category><category>交易陷阱</category></item><item><title>针对孩子的积分管理</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/kpi-4-kids.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;对孩子进行积分管理，效果出奇地好。真是出乎意料。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 20 May 2021 22:25:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2021-05-20:/kpi-4-kids.html</guid><category>essay</category><category>thought</category></item><item><title>交易陷阱之卖出的艺术</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/art-of-selling.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;俗话说，会买的是徒弟，会卖的才是师傅。本文结合自己的交易记录，谈谈在一个交易里犯的两个卖出错误。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 21 Apr 2021 23:13:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2021-04-21:/art-of-selling.html</guid><category>wealth</category><category>交易陷阱</category></item><item><title>职场官僚</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/career-bureaucrat.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;职场官僚，就是那些看起来高大上，但实际上，对组织没有实质性帮助的人。你周边有这样的职场官僚么？&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 15 Jan 2021 23:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2021-01-15:/career-bureaucrat.html</guid><category>essay</category><category>thought</category></item><item><title>好奇心与挫败感</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/curiosity-frustration.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;当发现自己某些地方做错了的时候，有些人会充满好奇心，去探究错在哪里。有些人则会充满挫败感，觉得自己一无是处。两种不同的反应，基本上决定了这个人的成长速度。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 14 Jan 2021 23:12:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2021-01-14:/curiosity-frustration.html</guid><category>essay</category><category>thought</category></item><item><title>从 U 盘安装 MacOS Big Sur 操作系统</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/upgrade-osx-by-usb.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Macbook Pro 2014 mid 款，从 U 盘安装 MacOS Big Sur 的方法及踩过的坑&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sun, 10 Jan 2021 23:23:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2021-01-10:/upgrade-osx-by-usb.html</guid><category>tools</category><category>tools</category></item><item><title>使用 PyCharm 单步调试 Django 单元测试例</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/debug-django-test-with-pycharm.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;本文介绍使用 PyCharm 对 Django 单元测试进行单步调试的方法。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2020 21:23:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2020-08-19:/debug-django-test-with-pycharm.html</guid><category>tools</category><category>pycharm</category><category>django</category><category>python</category></item><item><title>华为手表 GT2 GPS 性能评测</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/huawei-gt2.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;华为手表 GT2 GPS 性能评测&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2020 22:43:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2020-08-03:/huawei-gt2.html</guid><category>notes</category></item><item><title>我们需要一个怎么样的投资记账软件？</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/account-book.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我们到底需要一个什么样的投资记账软件呢？&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2020 22:43:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2020-08-01:/account-book.html</guid><category>wealth</category><category>长赢指数投资</category><category>操作分析</category></item><item><title>股市赚钱的终极秘密</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/earning-in-investment.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一条通过资本市场赚钱的终极秘密。大部分人都知道它，但只有很少一部分人能正确对待他。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 18 Jul 2020 21:23:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2020-07-18:/earning-in-investment.html</guid><category>wealth</category><category>投资理念</category></item><item><title>长赢指数投资计划 易方达消费行业 操作分析</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/long-win-1.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;分析长赢指数投资计划操作逻辑，验证投资系统，学习投资技巧&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 04 Jul 2020 23:12:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2020-07-04:/long-win-1.html</guid><category>wealth</category><category>长赢指数投资</category><category>操作分析</category></item><item><title>如何规划好大学生活</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/planning-college-life.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;作为公司雇佣品牌宣传的一部分，作为学长，应邀给厦门大学计算机学院大一的学生作主题演讲，谈谈如何规划好大学生活。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 18 Jul 2019 23:16:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2019-07-18:/planning-college-life.html</guid><category>essay</category><category>thought</category></item><item><title>网络安全的基础 - 数字证书及签名</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/security-basic-cert-sign.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;网络中怎么样确保数字内容是可信的？比如，怎么确保你连接的是招商银行的网站，而不是某李鬼的网站呢？本文将试着回答这个问题。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 31 Mar 2018 23:52:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2018-03-31:/security-basic-cert-sign.html</guid><category>web</category><category>web</category></item><item><title>基于 Gitlab 的源代码管理及开发模型</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/gitlab.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;团队准备从 SVN 切换到自建的 Git 开发模型，选择了 Gitlab CE 版本作为源码管理平台。本文描述的开发模型适用于嵌入式开发领域，这与 Web 相关产品开发模型有较大差别。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sun, 14 May 2017 20:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2017-05-14:/gitlab.html</guid><category>tools</category><category>tools</category></item><item><title>利用朴素贝叶斯算法进行文档分类</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/docs-classification.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;本文利用 scikit-learn 里的朴素贝叶斯算法对文档进行分类，以便更深入地理解贝叶斯算法。这不是篇介绍自然语言处理的文章，语料库直接使用英文，以避免介绍针对中文的分词技术。为了读者更好的理解原理，本文介绍了 TF-IDF ，这是一个表达词语权重信息的模型。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sun, 07 May 2017 23:43:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2017-05-07:/docs-classification.html</guid><category>ml</category><category>machine-learning</category></item><item><title>零基础学习朴素贝叶斯算法</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/naive-bayes.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;忘光了概率统计的知识还想学朴素贝叶斯算法？这一篇就是为你准备的。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sun, 30 Apr 2017 23:43:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2017-04-30:/naive-bayes.html</guid><category>ml</category><category>machine-learning</category></item><item><title>微信小程序离线开发文档</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/weapp-doc.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;边开发微信小程序边打开腾讯的微信小程序开发文档的网站，跳转慢，搜索渣？这里有一个更优雅的解决方法。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 01 Feb 2017 14:52:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2017-02-01:/weapp-doc.html</guid><category>weapp</category><category>weapp</category></item><item><title>微信小程序兼容性问题</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/weapp-capability.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;本文我们来谈变微信小程序系统兼容性的那些坑。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 19 Jan 2017 22:52:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2017-01-19:/weapp-capability.html</guid><category>weapp</category><category>weapp</category></item><item><title>macOS Sierra 上安装 mysqlclient 问题</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/mysqlclient.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;macOS Sieria 上安装 mysqlclient 遇到的坑&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 22 Dec 2016 23:23:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2016-12-22:/mysqlclient.html</guid><category>python</category><category>python</category></item><item><title>白话网站架构演进</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/web-arch-evolution.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;读写分离，负载均衡，DNS 动态解析，CDN, memcached, Redis, 动态扩容，你是否曾经被这些名词搞得晕头转向，然后发誓要搞清楚这些概念，然后就没有然后了。或许这篇文章可以让你下次和程序员聊天时可以插一两句话。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 02 Dec 2016 23:52:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2016-12-02:/web-arch-evolution.html</guid><category>web</category><category>web</category></item><item><title>React 最佳实践示例项目</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/react-best-practise-demo.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Github 上已经有一堆基于 React 的 HackerNews 客户端，为什么还需要一个新的？&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Wed, 09 Nov 2016 22:52:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2016-11-09:/react-best-practise-demo.html</guid><category>web</category><category>react</category></item><item><title>微信小程序原理</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/weapp-principle.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;微信小程序使用了前端技术栈 JavaScript/WXML/WXSS。它背后的原理是怎么样的呢？&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 05 Nov 2016 07:52:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2016-11-05:/weapp-principle.html</guid><category>weapp</category><category>weapp</category></item><item><title>step-by-step 构建 IPSec/IKEv2 VPN</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/ipsec-ikev2-vpn.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;升级到 iOS 10 和 macOS Sierra 后，安全性较差的 pptp vpn 服务器不能再使用了。那就搭个 IPSec/IKEv2 VPN 服务器吧。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Tue, 01 Nov 2016 23:22:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2016-11-01:/ipsec-ikev2-vpn.html</guid><category>tools</category><category>tools</category></item><item><title>跨平台 App 开发技术方案汇总</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/cross-platform-app-dev.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;跨平台 App 开发有哪些技术方案，各有哪些优缺点？是否需要从原生 App 开发切换到这些跨平台的方案上来？切换过去能节省多少工作量？&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sun, 23 Oct 2016 01:13:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2016-10-23:/cross-platform-app-dev.html</guid><category>tools</category><category>tools</category></item><item><title>瞎忙是一种福分</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/busy-without-purpose.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;愿好奇心不泯，愿有时间瞎忙。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 29 Sep 2016 00:13:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2016-09-29:/busy-without-purpose.html</guid><category>essay</category><category>thought</category></item><item><title>跑者蓝调</title><link>http://kamidox.github.io/running.html</link><description>&lt;p&gt;不知不觉已经坚持慢跑一年有余，大概因为觉得主动长期坚持一件枯燥的事情，总会有点感悟，总觉得应该写点什么，可似乎又无从谈起。看完村上春树的《当我谈跑步时我谈些什么》，似乎找到了一些知音的感觉，还是决定写点什么吧。&lt;/p&gt;</description><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Joey Huang</dc:creator><pubDate>Sat, 26 Mar 2016 21:22:00 +0800</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">tag:kamidox.github.io,2016-03-26:/running.html</guid><category>essay</category><category>thought</category></item></channel></rss>